{"channel": "engineering", "author": "gideon", "created_at": "2024-11-27T09:10:24+00:00", "text": "good instinct, I'd rather have a second set of eyes on those before they go in.", "thread_id": "m-engineering-2024-11-27-399", "reactions": [{"author": "dario", "emoji": "👍"}]}
